  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 FAQs\n\n### How to Match receipts to bank feed\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 17 Dec, 2025 at 11:13 AM\n\n\t\tMatching receipts to bank feed: The client must record the payment for the bill only then will the transaction be visible for reconciliation.\n\nNavigation : 365>>Client>>Purchases>>Bill \n\nEdit the Bill once done record the payment as shown below. As Payment is recorded transaction will be visible for reconciliation.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
